 erpretability to understand neural-network models. The aim is understandi
 ng computation and behavior across brains and AI systems.\nAdditional top
 ics: Cognitive Science & Computational Cognition\, Explainability & Inter
 pretability\nScope sources (2027): https://2027.ccneuro.org/\nScope last 
